OL,3,ANHS admits 'failing families' over
OL,4,Astillbirths
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn NHS trust has apologised after an
OL,7,Findependent review found that eight
OL,8,Fbabies might have survived with better
OL,9,Fmaternity care, admitting it has
OL,10,F"failed families".
OL,12,FThe stillbirths all occurred at the
OL,13,FEast Kent Hospitals NHS Trust's
OL,14,Fhospitals between June 2025 and March
OL,15,F2026.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
