OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ANHS admits 'failing families' over
OL,4,Astillbirths
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn independent review ordered by the
OL,7,Ftrust found systemic issues lay at the
OL,8,Fheart of the failures. These included
OL,9,Ffailures to manage high risk
OL,10,Fpregnancies, provide appropriate
OL,11,Ftriage, identify foetal growth
OL,12,Fconcerns, and make appropriate use of
OL,13,Finterpreter services.
OL,15,FSince the report, a further seven
OL,16,Fstillbirths have occurred, including
OL,17,Fthree last month. A review into those
OL,18,Fdeaths has now been ordered.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
